      "text": "Hold on to the moments that matter Be ready to act when sudden cardiac arrest strikes Life is built from small moments—coffee before sunrise, sideline cheers, a hand squeezed at the right time. Sudden cardiac arrest can happen to anyone, anywhere, interrupting those moments without warning. Our latest video shows us what’s worth protecting and how being prepared can help. Read More Tell us your cardiac arrest story EC-GSNPS-SYK-2235972",
